** ==================================================================
** ABAQUS/STANDARD HYDROGEN TRANSPORT: 1D VERIFICATION DECK
** SUBROUTINE: UMATHT (heat transfer analogy, NT11 = lattice C_L)
** Three independent bars of 40 DC3D8 elements, 1 x 1 mm section,
** each with its own analytical solution (see README, section 4):
**   BAR_A  permeation, lattice only:        C(0) = 1, C(L) = 0, L = 1 mm
**   BAR_B  permeation with Oriani traps:    N_T K_T / N_L = 9, D_eff = D_L / 10
**   BAR_C  closed bar, uniform grad sigma_h = 500 MPa/mm, C_init = 1, L = 2 mm
** Units: mm, s, MPa; concentration in mol/m3.
** STATUS: prepared, not yet run in Abaqus
** ==================================================================
*HEADING
Hydrogen transport UMATHT verification: permeation, trapping, stress-driven drift
**
