** ------------------------------------------------------------------
** 2. SECTIONS AND MATERIALS
** PROPS: D0_a [mm2/s], Q_a [J/mol], D0_g, Q_g, N_L [mol/m3],
**        V_H [mm3/mol], W_B [J/mol], N_T [mol/m3], KJ flag
** D_L = 0.01 mm2/s (Q = 0, temperature independent), N_L = 5.1E29
** sites/m3 = 8.46875E5 mol/m3, V_H = 2.0E-6 m3/mol = 2000 mm3/mol.
** BAR_B: W_B = 10 kJ/mol, K_T(20 C) = 60.50694, N_T = 9 N_L / K_T =
** 125967 mol/m3, so D_eff = D_L / 10 at low occupancy (theta_L K_T < 1E-4).
